{"id":"ca590e1d3ddcec76c575e85138a891a76ffaa44a","axis":"silent","repo":"elsa-workflows/elsa-core","sha":"ca590e1d3ddcec76c575e85138a891a76ffaa44a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/current-import-impact.yml","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,8 @@ on:","       - 'build/**'","       - 'scripts/integration-program/**'","       - 'Elsa.Apps.slnf'","+      - 'Elsa.Templates.slnf'","+      - 'scripts/solution/solution-groups.json'","       - 'core/samples/**'","       - 'extensions/samples/**'","       - 'studio/samples/**'"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".github/workflows/integration-program-tools.yml","lines":["@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ on:","       - 'docs/integration-program/consolidation/dependabot-recursive-discovery.md'","       - 'scripts/integration-program/**'","       - 'Elsa.Apps.slnf'","+      - 'Elsa.Templates.slnf'","+      - 'scripts/solution/solution-groups.json'","       - 'extensions/src/Elsa.Testing.Extensions/**'","       - 'extensions/samples/workbench/**'","       - 'docs/integration-program/verify-hierarchy.py'"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".github/workflows/solution-groups.yml","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ on:","       - 'Elsa.sln'","       - '*.slnf'","       - '**/*.csproj'","+      - '**/*.slnx'","       - 'scripts/solution/**'","       - '.github/workflows/solution-groups.yml'"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".github/workflows/templates-source-validation.yml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,90 @@","+# Task #8748 source acceptance. Publisher/trust ownership remains #8741/#8725.","+# Retain this product gate after import; templates/.github workflows are inert metadata.","+name: Templates source validation","+","+on:","+  pull_request:","+    paths:","+      - 'templates/**'","+      - 'Elsa.sln'","+      - 'Elsa.Templates.slnf'","+      - 'scripts/solution/**'","+      - 'scripts/integration-program/verify_templates_source_import.py'","+      - 'scripts/integration-program/templates_product_inventory.py'","+      - 'scripts/integration-program/test_verify_templates_source_import.py'","+      - 'scripts/integration-program/apps_consumer_inventory.py'","+      - 'docs/integration-program/templates-source-import.json'","+      - '.github/workflows/templates-source-validation.yml'","+  workflow_dispatch:","+","+permissions:","+  contents: read","+","+concurrency:","+  group: templates-source-${{ github.event.pull_request.number || github.ref }}","+  cancel-in-progress: true","+","+env:","+  EXPECTED_HEAD: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha || github.sha }}","+","+jobs:","+  templates:","+    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04","+    timeout-minutes: 40","+    steps:","+      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262 # v4","+        with:","+          repository: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.repo.full_name || github.repository }}","+          ref: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha || github.sha }}","+          fetch-depth: 0","+          persist-credentials: false","+      - name: Verify candidate identity","+        run: test \"$(git rev-parse HEAD)\" = \"$EXPECTED_HEAD\"","+      - uses: actions/setup-dotnet@67a3573c9a986a3f9c594539f4ab511d57bb3ce9 # v4.3.1","+        with:","+          dotnet-version: '10.0.300'","+      - name: Verify original source and independent project boundaries","+        run: |","+          python3 -m unittest discover -s scripts/integration-program -p 'test_verify_templates_source_import.py' -v","+          python3 -O -m unittest discover -s scripts/integration-program -p 'test_verify_templates_source_import.py' -v","+          dotnet msbuild Elsa.Templates.slnf -t:GenerateRestoreGraphFile \\","+            -p:RestoreGraphOutputPath=\"$RUNNER_TEMP/templates-restore-graph.json\" -nologo -v:quiet","+          python3 scripts/integration-program/verify_templates_source_import.py --evaluate \\","+            --restore-graph \"$RUNNER_TEMP/templates-restore-graph.json\"","+      - name: Verify retained publisher metadata guards without publishing","+        run: python3 -m unittest discover -s templates/test -p 'validate_packages_workflow.py' -v","+      - name: Restore and build the independent product and root filter","+        run: |","+          dotnet restore Elsa.Templates.slnf --force-evaluate","+          dotnet restore templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx","+          dotnet build templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx -c Release --no-restore","+          dotnet build Elsa.Templates.slnf -c Release --no-restore","+      - name: Pack, install and build the 20 supported starter cases","+        run: |","+          dotnet test templates/test/Elsa.Templates.Tests/Elsa.Templates.Tests.csproj \\","+            -c Release --no-build --logger trx --results-directory \"$RUNNER_TEMP/templates-results\"","+      - name: Verify all existing smoke cases ran and passed","+        run: |","+          python3 - <<'PY'","+          import os","+          from pathlib import Path","+          import xml.etree.ElementTree as ET","+          results = list((Path(os.environ['RUNNER_TEMP']) / 'templates-results').glob('*.trx'))","+          if len(results) != 1:","+              raise SystemExit('Expected one Templates smoke-test receipt')","+          counters = ET.parse(results[0]).find('.//{*}Counters')","+          if counters is None or any(counters.get(key) != '20' for key in ('total', 'executed', 'passed')) or counters.get('failed') != '0':","+              raise SystemExit('All 20 supported template smoke cases must execute and pass')","+          PY","+      - name: Verify tracked source remained unchanged","+        run: git diff --exit-code HEAD --","+      - name: Retain nonpublishing test evidence","+        if: always()","+        uses: actions/upload-artifact@ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02 # v4.6.2","+        with:","+          name: templates-source-${{ github.run_id }}-${{ github.run_attempt }}","+          path: |","+            ${{ runner.temp }}/templates-results/*.trx","+            ${{ runner.temp }}/templates-restore-graph.json","+          if-no-files-found: warn","+          retention-days: 14"],"additions":90,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -5,8 +5,8 @@ Guidance for AI coding agents working in this repository."," ## Project Overview"," "," - Elsa Core is a .NET solution centered on `Elsa.sln`.","-- Products live under `core/`, `extensions/`, `studio/`, and `apps/`. Apps contains official released-package application hosts and Python container-policy tests under `apps/scripts/tests/`; its contributor entrypoint is [Apps](apps/README.md).","-- The root solution, solution filters, build automation, scripts and central policy are shared.","+- Products live under `core/`, `extensions/`, `studio/`, `apps/`, and `templates/`. Apps contains official released-package application hosts and Python container-policy tests under `apps/scripts/tests/`; its contributor entrypoint is [Apps](apps/README.md).","+- The root solution, solution filters, build automation, scripts and central policy are shared. Templates keeps its independent product solution; root `Elsa.sln` includes navigation items only for that product."," - Read the product documentation entrypoints: [Core](core/docs/README.md), [Extensions](extensions/docs/README.md), [Studio](studio/docs/README.md), and [Apps](apps/docs/README.md)."," - Build automation is implemented with NUKE in `build/Build.cs` and exposed through `build.sh`, `build.ps1`, and `build.cmd`."," ","@@ -33,7 +33,8 @@ Guidance for AI coding agents working in this repository."," - Run NUKE test target: `./build.sh Test`"," - Build with dotnet directly: `dotnet build Elsa.sln`"," - Focus a product build with `dotnet build Elsa.Core.slnf`, `dotnet build Elsa.Extensions.slnf`, `dotnet build Elsa.Studio.slnf`, or `dotnet build Elsa.Apps.slnf`; see product docs for selection boundaries.","-- Run all tests directly: `dotnet test Elsa.sln`","+- Build Templates separately: `dotnet build Elsa.Templates.slnf` or `dotnet build templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx`; test with `dotnet test templates/test/Elsa.Templates.Tests/Elsa.Templates.Tests.csproj`. Read [Templates guidance](templates/AGENTS.md) before changing that product.","+- Run shared-solution tests directly: `dotnet test Elsa.sln`"," - Run a specific test project: `dotnet test core/test/unit/Elsa.Workflows.Core.UnitTests/Elsa.Workflows.Core.UnitTests.csproj`"," - Run ElsaScript DSL integration tests: `./run-dsl-tests.sh`"," ","@@ -54,6 +55,7 @@ Prefer targeted `dotnet test <project>` commands while iterating, then run a bro"," - `extensions/src/`, `extensions/test/`, `extensions/docs/`, `extensions/samples/`: Extensions-owned code, tests, documentation and samples."," - `studio/src/`, `studio/test/`, `studio/docs/`, `studio/samples/`: Studio-owned code, tests, documentation and samples. Read [Studio contributor guidance](studio/src/AGENTS.md) for Studio modules, hosts, frameworks and tests."," - `apps/src/`, `apps/scripts/`, `apps/docs/`: official net10 application/image hosts, container policy tests and source-import guidance. Read [Apps agent guidance](apps/AGENTS.md). Apps consumes released packages and does not add Core NuGet release units.","+- `templates/src/`, `templates/test/`, `templates/docs/`: independent Elsa 3 .NET project-template pack, smoke tests and contributor guidance. Embedded starter project files are data; keep all Templates projects outside root `Elsa.sln` packing."," - `core/docs/specs/` and `studio/docs/specs/`: product feature plans and specifications."," - `docs/adr/`: shared architecture decisions; `docs/integration-program/`: retained consolidation and proof records."," - `build/`, `scripts/`, `docker/`, root solution/filter files and central `Directory.*` files: shared tooling and policy."],"additions":5,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"Elsa.Templates.slnf","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@","+{","+  \"solution\": {","+    \"path\": \"templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx\",","+    \"projects\": [","+      \"src/Elsa.Templates/Elsa.Templates.csproj\",","+      \"test/Elsa.Templates.Tests/Elsa.Templates.Tests.csproj\"","+    ]","+  }","+}"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Elsa.sln","lines":["@@ -869,6 +869,13 @@ Project(\"{FAE04EC0-301F-11D3-BF4B-00C04F79EFBC}\") = \"Elsa.Studio.BlazorWasm\", \"a"," EndProject"," Project(\"{FAE04EC0-301F-11D3-BF4B-00C04F79EFBC}\") = \"Shared\", \"apps\\src\\Shared\\Shared.csproj\", \"{C164DE46-8179-4DBE-8AB7-5EE356D9BF13}\""," EndProject","+Project(\"{2150E333-8FDC-42A3-9474-1A3956D46DE8}\") = \"Templates\", \"Templates\", \"{4052D9B8-2F2A-491D-918C-E068FAED3D30}\"","+\tProjectSection(SolutionItems) = preProject","+\t\ttemplates\\Elsa.Templates.slnx = templates\\Elsa.Templates.slnx","+\t\tElsa.Templates.slnf = Elsa.Templates.slnf","+\t\ttemplates\\README.md = templates\\README.md","+\tEndProjectSection","+EndProject"," Project(\"{2150E333-8FDC-42A3-9474-1A3956D46DE8}\") = \"Apps\", \"Apps\", \"{295C9828-41EA-5AAF-8451-2A366FEF2A5E}\""," EndProject"," Project(\"{2150E333-8FDC-42A3-9474-1A3956D46DE8}\") = \"Tests\", \"Tests\", \"{E26ABACB-8C6D-52E5-9453-0A0A46664BAD}\""],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"README.md","lines":["@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@ docker run \\"," - [Studio source and local development](studio/docs/README.md)"," - [Extensions source and package boundaries](extensions/docs/README.md)"," - [Official application hosts and images](apps/README.md)","+- [.NET project templates](templates/README.md)"," - [Consolidated 3.10 package proof and publication boundaries](docs/integration-program/consolidated-package-proof.md)"," "," ## Training","@@ -198,6 +199,7 @@ Open the root `Elsa.sln` in Visual Studio, JetBrains Rider or Visual Studio Code"," - [Extensions development](extensions/docs/README.md): extension modules, tests and samples."," - [Studio development](studio/docs/README.md): Blazor hosts, browser bundles and Studio tests."," - [Apps development](apps/README.md): official net10 hosts and six image profiles consuming released packages.","+- [Templates development](templates/docs/README.md): independent Elsa 3 project-template pack and isolated starter smoke tests. Build `Elsa.Templates.slnf`, which selects `templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx`; Templates has navigation items only in the shared solution to preserve independent packaging."," "," Run build and test commands from the repository root. See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for the workflow and [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for repository conventions. These source-development commands do not publish packages or change source-repository ownership."," "],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/integration-program/consolidation/dependabot-recursive-discovery.md","lines":["@@ -115,6 +115,12 @@ governed by [#8636](https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-core/issues/8636) and"," The historical inventory table above predates these nine additions; the five selected"," starting-set counts and existing release-unit inventory are unchanged."," ","+## Templates product and build-data disposition","+","+Task [#8748](https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-core/issues/8748) retains nine Templates manifests outside the shared solution and the five updater batches. The explicit current inventory in `scripts/solution/solution-groups.json` separates the independent pack and test project from six embedded starter manifests and one standalone legacy host. Root `Elsa.Templates.slnf` selects `templates/Elsa.Templates.slnx`, with project paths relative to the product solution; root `Elsa.sln` has navigation items only. The census fails on unknown or unaccounted Templates projects, accidental shared-solution membership and build/data overlap. No Templates updater is activated.","+","+Templates uses scoped props, CPM, targets and official-only NuGet configuration. Its [source workflow](../../../.github/workflows/templates-source-validation.yml) owns real pack/install/generate/build proof. The [import record](../templates-source-import.md) preserves the exact original65-file mapping and independent release/publisher handoff. The historical inventory table and five source-package starting-set counts above remain unchanged.","+"," ## Central package and build imports"," "," The coverage test walks from each of the 356 selected project manifests to its nearest"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/integration-program/templates-source-import.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,531 @@","+{","+  \"schemaVersion\": 1,","+  \"sourceRepository\": \"https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-templates\",","+  \"coreBase\": \"1d5bc1e1deaba8f2d90920109061a3504a945106\",","+  \"sourceCommit\": \"891759727db053a37911b616ace4a5599e1005d0\",","+  \"sourceTree\": \"0de85b0ca906f6be6559998768378f5c9fb03bb6\",","+  \"sourceHistoryCommits\": 41,","+  \"mainHistoryCommits\": 29,","+  \"sourceRefs\": [","+    {","+      \"ref\": \"refs/heads/main\",","+      \"sha\": \"891759727db053a37911b616ace4a5599e1005d0\",","+      \"type\": \"commit\",","+      \"commit\": \"891759727db053a37911b616ace4a5599e1005d0\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"ref\": \"refs/pull/1/head\",","+      \"sha\": \"4fbeb9ad28ff16fd0ac576b3a99df50df85d1634\",","+      \"type\": \"commit\",","+      \"commit\": \"4fbeb9ad28ff16fd0ac576b3a99df50df85d1634\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"ref\": \"refs/pull/10/head\",","+      \"sha\": \"507fba847cb52ec4300ebe45bb4e30cbf9e531b0\",","+      \"type\": \"commit\",","+      \"commit\": \"507fba847cb52ec4300ebe45bb4e30cbf9e531b0\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"ref\": \"refs/pull/11/head\",","+      \"sha\": \"d507a0a14ef6efe3b52939d0c0b9af8d744f50ff\",","+      \"type\": \"commit\",","+      \"commit\": \"d507a0a14ef6efe3b52939d0c0b9af8d744f50ff\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"ref\": \"refs/pull/12/head\",","+      \"sha\": \"894e2e165a48ebc908dcd81277d8f7b9dca29146\",","+      \"type\": \"commit\",","+      \"commit\": \"